  "answer_text": "Yes. Cato supports IPv6-only branch sites. For Socket sites, IPv6-only connectivity is supported from Socket v26.0.23517+ and uses IPv4-over-IPv6 mechanisms (IPIP6 Static) to connect the Socket to the Cato Cloud while preserving IPv4 for applications. The knowledge base does not publish roadmap details or dates for next year.",
